Hi,

on the planning phone meeting for the OpenPrinting Summit yesterday we 
decided on giving more time to the Common Printing Dialog as we expect 
more discussion there. Therefore we will talk about color management 
only up to lunch and directly after lunch we will talk about printing 
from applications for 45 minutes. The rest of the day will be dedicated 
to the Common Printing Dialog. See

https://www.linuxfoundation.org/en/OpenPrinting/OpenPrinting_Summit_San_Francisco_2009

Please upload and link your slides.

